@cindex package-local nicknames
@partofpln

Return an @spectermref{alist} which describes the
@termrefl{package-local nickname,local nicknames} which are defined in
@var{package}.

@var{package} is a @spectermrefl{package_designator,package designator}.

Elements of the returned alist are of the form
@code{(@var{local-nickname} . @var{nicknamed-package})} where
@var{local-nickname} is a string and @var{nicknamed-package} is a
package object.
